      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The text 'something went terribly wrong' maps onto the visual contrast between 1947 and 2017",
      "description": "The top text 'something went... terribly wrong' is mapped onto the visual juxtaposition of the formal 1947 portrait and the 2017 street scene. This mapping implies that the perceived cultural or moral decline from 1947 to 2017 (as represented by the visual contrast) is what 'went terribly wrong'. The text serves as a commentary on the visual material, attributing a negative historical narrative to the visual contrast.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
